>

"to catch" usually implies an intentional action but "catching cold" is
usually unintentional thus {kavbu} won't work even if kavbu2 is a property.

But there might be another opinion.
Anyway, {cpacu lo ka bilma fi la .zuKAM.} might work anyway.



